How to use this file:
  Run it with Python to write out the playable game as an .html file:
      python3 auaha_game.py
  Then open Auaha_Game.html in a real browser (see note on iPhone below).

  Or just copy the AUAHA_GAME_HTML string below on its own, it is the
  complete, valid HTML document, paste it into any tool (including
